The experiment-neutral optical core (scintfibrefastsim.core: counter, binning, optics,
materials, transport, run, limits) was copied from crvfastsim.lookupgen.core in
RobMina/mu2e-fastsim and is re-exported there via pull request #326
(crvfastsim.lookupgen.core.* are the same module objects as scintfibrefastsim.core.*).
That core is a JAX port of the table mode of the public Mu2e/CRVStandalone optical
simulation (Apache-2.0); material tables and Geant4 10.7 optical semantics are cited
in the module docstrings. Golden regression tests guard bit-compatibility of the
transport outputs for fixed toy seeds.

The photosensor backends (Mu2e SiPM, NOvA APD), geometry-family helpers, Geant4
validation hooks, Diátaxis docs and examples were written for this package.

Cite CRVStandalone and Offline ports when publishing tables derived from this code.

No experiment-internal inputs, conditions, data, libraries or physics results are part
of this repository.
